 # Retained-prefix audit plan
 
 Status: auditor source prepared, not executed. This audit never imports candidate
-modules, compiles, launches or signals a process. Its only write is a new exclusive
-`AUDIT.json`; all SQLite connections use URI`mode=ro&immutable=1` and`query_only=ON`,
+modules, compiles, launches or signals a process. Its only output is a new exclusive
+`AUDIT.json`, published from one exclusive`.AUDIT.json.pending` temporary using a
+non-overwriting hard link after file fsync; all SQLite connections use URI`mode=ro&immutable=1` and`query_only=ON`,
 and each DB is hashed before and after the read.
+
+The auditor hashes its own source at the beginning and end. Root must verify the
+reviewed source pin before launch and require terminal0 plus a complete canonical
+receipt. A post-publication directory-fsync failure can leave complete verified
+bytes but a nonzero command result; that is not a successful audit invocation.
+Failed temporary/final outputs are retained, never automatically overwritten.
 
 The actual matrix stopped at the mutation profile's unchanged30-second wall
 limit. Negative passed8 cases/136 checks; storage passed10 cases/122 checks.
